    <h2>The Mushroom Swiss — DQ's Umami Stackburger</h2>
  <p>The Mushroom Swiss Stackburger delivers a different flavor dimension than most DQ burgers. Where the <a href="/items/flamethrower-stackburger">FlameThrower</a> delivers heat and the <a href="/items/backyard-bacon-ranch-stackburger">Backyard Bacon Ranch</a> delivers smoky-sweet flavors, the Mushroom Swiss is built around savory umami depth from sautéed mushrooms and Swiss cheese. It is the most "steakhouse adjacent" Stackburger on the menu. See the full burger lineup on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>What's on the Mushroom Swiss Stackburger</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>100% real seasoned beef patty</strong> — Never frozen, cooked to order</li>
    <li><strong>Sautéed mushrooms</strong> — Tender, golden brown, earthy flavor</li>
    <li><strong>Swiss cheese</strong> — Mild, slightly nutty — melted on the patty</li>
    <li><strong>Creamy mushroom sauce</strong> — Brings all three mushroom elements together</li>
    <li><strong>Toasted bun</strong> — Slightly more substantial than standard buns to hold the mushrooms</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Mushroom Swiss vs. Other Stackburgers</h2>
